{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06743","headline":"同从弟销南斋玩月忆山阴崔少府 · 王昌龄","name":"同从弟销南斋玩月忆山阴崔少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高卧南斋时，开帷月初吐。\n清辉淡水木，演漾在窗户。\n苒苒几盈虚，澄澄变今古。\n美人清江畔，是夜越吟苦。\n千里其如何，微风吹兰杜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}